								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg15268#msg15268">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2376 on:</b> March 07, 2005, 05:03:53 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							EQ is I guess like RL in alot of forms. EQ has evolved to a point where only the strong survive. That includes doing whatever it takes to survive. Although I do not agree with it Justyse put it best. There is nowhere else for them to go and effectively remain strong enough to survive. That is just how it I guess at this stage of EQ.
						</td>
