								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org" title="http://www.rodcetnife.org" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:truman@thewavz.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg15269#msg15269"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg15269#msg15269">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2377 on:</b> March 07, 2005, 05:07:01 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Eh, it&#039;s been that way for some time really, since PoP, the number of guilds that had people who wandered about, and played free agency has dropped signifigantly.<br /><br />Only way to see an end to it would be a server merger.<br /><br />Don&#039;t get me wrong, not saying I approve, but since there was nothing I could do about Ascent doing the same to FoT and everyone else all the time, all I could do was refuse thier apps/alts flags, and leave it at that.<br /><br />Did it stop them? Nope.<br /><br />Did it solve anything? Nope.<br /><br />But I knew they would get nothing free from our people from that point forward, and would have to work it for themselves.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
