						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg15271#msg15271"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg15271#msg15271">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2379 on:</b> March 07, 2005, 05:47:32 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg15270#msg15270">Quote from: Spaerhawk on March 07, 2005, 05:42:14 pm</a></div><div class="quote"><div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg15256#msg15256">Quote from: Slayyerr on March 07, 2005, 03:57:29 pm</a></div><div class="quote">Recruiting within another guilds ranks is a breach of ethics. If it was friends among friends, I highly doubt it would happen now. I know for a fact that some of our clerics recruited did not know the EiE recruiters, so IMO ethical breach. <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/bitching.gif" alt="Bitching" border="0" /><br /></div><br />Well you better tell your RoS officers about that ethics breach with all the UoP members you&#039;ve guilded.<br /><br /><span style="font-size: 7pt;">(And no, not you personally. The guild as a whole.)</span><br /></div><br /><br />lol
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
