								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg15272#msg15272">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2380 on:</b> March 07, 2005, 06:22:41 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Debating ethics in Everquest is almost retarded. Ethics are relative, and have no place in a game that centers around killing gods... </div><br />&nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wtf1.gif" alt="WTF" border="0" /><br /><br />I&#039;ll take Totally Irrelevant for 500, Alex!&nbsp; <br /><br />Train, KS, corpse camp, ninja loot, scam, steal, and hack to the best of your ability in EQ because ethics have no place here!&nbsp; For proof I submit to you that you can kill gods here!&nbsp; 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
